          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.83,
          "end": 33.45,
          "en": "So, we can use ChatGPT to create a YouTube video script.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 37.05,
