          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 57.48,
          "en": "to make sure it doesn't consider",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.48,
          "end": 60.15,
          "en": "the executive summary instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.15,
          "end": 63.933,
          "en": "Now let's see where this pretty wake prompt leads us to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.46,
          "end": 68.88,
          "en": "So this is a nice first step at least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.88,
          "end": 73.44,
          "en": "but as we saw it for the article, it is pretty generic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
